### Negative control for `make reasoner`: one individual typed with two classes
### the ontology declares disjoint (owl:AllDisjointClasses in
### model/ontology-overlay.ttl), so the harness proves HermiT can still find an
### inconsistency. If the disjointness axioms stop reaching ontology/martialis.ttl,
### this fixture reasons as consistent and the step fails.

@prefix martialis: <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#> .

<https://martial.is/entity/control-disjoint> a martialis:Person, martialis:Style .
